\item \code{"ar6"} (default): IPCC AR6 (2021) Table 7.15, biogenic CH4 = 27,
N2O = 273.
\item \code{"ar5"}: IPCC AR5 (2013), CH4 = 28, N2O = 265 (no climate-carbon
feedback).
\item \code{"ar4"}: IPCC AR4 (2007), CH4 = 25, N2O = 298.
